<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuehne &amp; Nagel in deal with Dupont.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel in deal with Dupont.</headline>
<dateline>SCHINDELLEGI, Switzerland 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss freight forwarder Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG said it had signed an agreement with DuPont Co. that covers the distribution activities of the U.S. chemical and energy company in Europe, the Middle East and Africa.</p>
<p>The agreement covers DuPont's annual freight volume of around one million tonnes on road, sea and air, Kuehne &amp; Nagel said in a statement.</p>
<p>As part of the agreement, DuPont will transfer all its European distribution that takes place by road, rail, air and sea to Kuehne &amp; Nagel.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
